That figure assumed every NADH gives exactly three ATP and every FADH two exactly two.

4
00:00:11,458 --> 00:00:16,080
Chemiosmosis showed the ratios need not be whole numbers.

5
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:23,450
Write thirty to thirty-two, and if thirty-eight comes up, call it the classical figure and say why it is too high.

